    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AFS Group","url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/company/afs-group-bv"},"datePublished":"2026-09-22T09:30:36.387Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":5},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_2025-esg-report-hr-highlights-activity-7508095397320454144-Kguy","text":"Sustainability isn’t just about the environment, but also the people behind it. \nTo build a truly responsible future, investing in our workforce isn't optional; it's essential.\n\nAt AFS Group, our commitment to ESG starts from within: empowering our team with continuous growth, supporting professional development, and proactively planning ahead for future initiatives.\n\n🔗 View the full report here: https://lnkd.in/eQ7zb7Wk\n\n#SustainableWorkforce #ESGReport #PeopleFirst #AFSGroup","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_2025-esg-report-hr-highlights-activity-7508095397320454144-Kguy"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AFS Group","url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/company/afs-group-bv"},"datePublished":"2026-09-18T09:06:17.573Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":58},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_vennex-afsgroup-privatemarkets-activity-7506639727148785664-mrVB","text":"AFS Group is pleased to introduce Vennex, a digital platform designed to support the professional administration and transferability of shares, certificates and bonds for privately held companies, funds and STAKs.\n\nVennex brings shareholder administration, investor management and secondary trading together within one integrated environment, helping organisations improve operational efficiency, reduce administrative complexity and provide investors with greater transparency.\n\nSupported by AFS Group’s regulated financial infrastructure and more than 175 years of experience in European financial markets, Vennex provides businesses with a scalable framework for managing ownership and facilitating liquidity.\n\nMove equity forward.\n\n🔗 Learn more: www.vennex.eu\n\n#Vennex #AFSGroup #PrivateMarkets #CapitalMarkets #FinTech","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_vennex-afsgroup-privatemarkets-activity-7506639727148785664-mrVB"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AFS Group","url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/company/afs-group-bv"},"datePublished":"2026-09-17T12:15:09.274Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":18},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_afs-group-2025-esg-report-activity-7506324867881824256-OnAo","text":"We just published our latest ESG report findings, taking a deep dive into our Scope 1–3 emissions and full category breakdown. \n \nSwipe through the slides for a sneak peek into our report, which highlights: \n🔹 The Data: Our full Scope 1–3 emissions breakdown.\n🔹The Targets: Key reduction projects planned for 2026.\n🔹The Engine: The carbon footprint platform keeping us accountable and on track.\n\n🔗 View the full report here: https://lnkd.in/eQ7zb7Wk\n\n#EmissionsReporting #Scope3 #Decarbonisation #CarbonFootprint #ClimateAction","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_afs-group-2025-esg-report-activity-7506324867881824256-OnAo"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AFS Group","url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/company/afs-group-bv"},"datePublished":"2026-09-14T06:03:42.822Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":10},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_eurofinance2026-networking-financeleaders-activity-7505144228398755840-4Ya3","text":"Heading to Eurofinance? Connect with the AFS Origination Desk!\n\nAt the AFS Origination Desk we help (listed) corporates reach their funding targets. With best in class connections to money and capital markets, we originate debt and connect our clients to a wide range of investors, such as pension funds, insurance companies, asset managers, governments and banks. We add value by broadening your investor base, lowering your costs of funding and giving you more flexibility compared to \"standardised\" banking debt.\n\nWe do this by offering competitive pricing, flexible covenants, tenors, and a wide range of documentation to tailor the funding to your needs.Our tailor-made market research provides you with better insight into the financial market, enabling you to make well-informed decisions. \n\n🤝 Our team will be on-site on September 16th-18th in Barcelona.\n\n#Eurofinance2026 #Networking #FinanceLeaders","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_eurofinance2026-networking-financeleaders-activity-7505144228398755840-4Ya3"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AFS Group","url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/company/afs-group-bv"},"datePublished":"2026-09-14T05:57:25.857Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":0},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_eurofinance2026-networking-financeleaders-activity-7505142647293034496-a1Kg","text":"Attending the Eurofinance 2026? Our Middle East Desk team will be on-site!\n\nWe currently work with more than 160 GCC and broader MENA region financial institutions and are actively expanding our presence in North Africa. We support you in deposits, CD/CP, T-Bills, Bonds, and FX-swaps. What differentiates us from other brokers is our strong understanding of Islamic finance and Sharia-compliant market structures.\n\nThis allows us to source opportunities from both Islamic counterparties and conventional institutions willing to transact under Sharia-compliant structures, providing our clients broader access to liquidity.\n\n🤝 Stop by to speak with our team on September 16th-18th in Barcelona, to discuss how we can support your strategic goals.\n\n#Eurofinance2026 #Networking #FinanceLeaders","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_eurofinance2026-networking-financeleaders-activity-7505142647293034496-a1Kg"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AFS Group","url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/company/afs-group-bv"},"datePublished":"2026-09-14T05:54:15.183Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":1},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_eurofinance2026-networking-financeleaders-activity-7505141847535640576-yP32","text":"Attending Eurofinance? Connect with the AFS Fixed Income team!\n\nAFS Fixed income desk trades bonds globally with end clients like: bank treasuries, asset managers, insurance companies, pension funds, hedge funds. We trade mainly in hard currency from government bonds\nto IG - HY bonds.\n\nWe are also active on private placements and less liquid asset classes. We have 10 people on our desk with different nationalities. Because we trade with end clients, we can trade mid-market and have better pricing than most investment banks. We can trade via Bloomberg RFQ and we provide all necessary MIFID II reporting to APA and ARM.\n\n🤝 Stop by to speak with our team on September 16th-18th in Barcelona, to discuss how we can support and add value to your execution strategy.\n\n#Eurofinance2026 #Networking #FinanceLeaders","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_eurofinance2026-networking-financeleaders-activity-7505141847535640576-yP32"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AFS Group","url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/company/afs-group-bv"},"datePublished":"2026-09-14T05:52:28.179Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":4},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_eurofinance2026-networking-financeleaders-activity-7505141398711685120-YBWX","text":"Let's connect at Eurofinance! 🤝 Our Asia Desk team will be on-site!\n\nAt the Asia Desk of AFS Interest, the leading European bridge for Asian financial institutions, we accelerate your international trading.\n\nOur dedicated team of six brokers eliminates cross-border complexity by supporting your business natively in English, Chinese, Japanese, and Korean.\n\nThrough this seamless, multilingual approach, we deliver tailored market advice and help you optimize your portfolio with competitive brokering in deposits, CD/CP, T-Bills, Bonds, and FX-swaps.\n\nOur team will be on-site on September 16th-18th in Barcelona. Drop by for a quick chat or connect with us at asia-desk@afsgroup.nl\n\n\n#Eurofinance2026 #Networking #FinanceLeaders\n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_eurofinance2026-networking-financeleaders-activity-7505141398711685120-YBWX"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AFS Group","url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/company/afs-group-bv"},"datePublished":"2026-09-10T12:00:34.699Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":23},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_afsgroup-esg-esgreport-activity-7503784484589367296-Jlfy","text":"Building Responsible Futures.\n\nAFS Group has published its 2025 Environmental, Social &\nGovernance Report, providing a transparent overview of our progress across\nenvironmental stewardship, social responsibility and corporate governance.\n\nThe report covers our first formal greenhouse gas emissions\nbaseline, our contribution to environmental markets, the development and\nwellbeing of our people, and the priorities guiding our next phase.\n\n🔗 Download the report to explore our progress: https://lnkd.in/eQ7zb7Wk\n\n#AFSGroup #ESG #ESGReport #Sustainability\n#CorporateGovernance","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_afsgroup-esg-esgreport-activity-7503784484589367296-Jlfy"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AFS Group","url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/company/afs-group-bv"},"datePublished":"2026-09-08T06:31:00.528Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":8},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_eurofinance2026-networking-financeleaders-activity-7502976770275438592-BMZU","text":"Attending Eurofinance? Connect with the AFS Money Market team!\n\nAs a leading money market broker and established primary dealer in Commercial Paper & Certificates of Deposit, AFS Interest connects a rapidly growing network of top-tier investors and issuers. \n\nWe serve as a trusted counterpart for a diverse range of clients, including supranationals, corporates, banks, sovereign, and sub-sovereign entities. Our dedicated CP & CD desk delivers global market access and investor diversification for our issuers across all currencies, geographies, and maturities.\n\n🤝 Our team will be on-site on September 16th-18th in Barcelona.\n\n#Eurofinance2026 #Networking #FinanceLeaders","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_eurofinance2026-networking-financeleaders-activity-7502976770275438592-BMZU"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AFS Group","url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/company/afs-group-bv"},"datePublished":"2026-09-08T06:30:29.447Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":0},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_eurofinance2026-networking-financeleaders-activity-7502976639945928704-0Nit","text":"Heading to Eurofinance? Connect with the AFS Research Desk!\n\nIn a world with geopolitics this uncertain and markets often on a knife edge, corporate treasurers need to know what's coming next. \n\nOur dedicated Research Desk delivers the market intelligence that fits your strategic needs. By combining deep-dive central bank analysis including the Fed, ECB and SNB with specialized money market research and precise spread forecasting, we help anticipate liquidity shifts before they happen, minimize funding costs and optimize your hedging strategies.\n\n Our timely news and market commentaries provide the forward-looking insights needed to stay ahead of the market, ensuring your team can deliver its best possible performance.\n\n🤝 Our team will be on-site on September 16th-18th in Barcelona.\n\n#Eurofinance2026 #Networking #FinanceLeaders","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/afs-group-bv_eurofinance2026-networking-financeleaders-activity-7502976639945928704-0Nit"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"AFS Group","url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/company/afs-group-bv","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Beursplein 5","addressLocality":"Amsterdam","postalCode":"1012JW","addressCountry":"NL"},"description":"AFS Group is an independent European multi-asset class broker, primarily operating as an intermediary for Financial Institutions, Corporate Clients and (semi) Government bodies. With offices in Amsterdam, London, Zurich and Frankfurt, AFS offers a range of Fixed Income, Interest Rates, Energy / Environmental, Exotics, Equity and Equity derivatives products. AFS also offers a variety of market information, data services and dedicated research. AFS has 150 employees.","numberOfEmployees":{"value":284,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQFXUjyT3OKezQ/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1672738124358/afs_group_bv_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=JO1yuUWu-RYlscRWtkbtvqfCzKHRcnnq5HMVeh2JVSU","description":"AFS Group","@type":"ImageObject"},"sameAs":"http://www.AFSGroup.nl"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
