  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">AFS Group is pleased to introduce Vennex, a digital platform designed to support the professional administration and transferability of shares, certificates and bonds for privately held companies, funds and STAKs.

Vennex brings shareholder administration, investor management and secondary trading together within one integrated environment, helping organisations improve operational efficiency, reduce administrative complexity and provide investors with greater transparency.

Supported by AFS Group’s regulated financial infrastructure and more than 175 years of experience in European financial markets, Vennex provides businesses with a scalable framework for managing ownership and facilitating liquidity.

Move equity forward.

