  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Attending Eurofinance? Connect with the AFS Fixed Income team!

AFS Fixed income desk trades bonds globally with end clients like: bank treasuries, asset managers, insurance companies, pension funds, hedge funds. We trade mainly in hard currency from government bonds
to IG - HY bonds.

We are also active on private placements and less liquid asset classes. We have 10 people on our desk with different nationalities. Because we trade with end clients, we can trade mid-market and have better pricing than most investment banks. We can trade via Bloomberg RFQ and we provide all necessary MIFID II reporting to APA and ARM.

🤝 Stop by to speak with our team on September 16th-18th in Barcelona, to discuss how we can support and add value to your execution strategy.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Feurofinance2026&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Eurofinance2026</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fnetworking&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Networking</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ffinanceleaders&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#FinanceLeaders</a></p>
