    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Let's connect at Eurofinance! 🤝 Our Asia Desk team will be on-site!

At the Asia Desk of AFS Interest, the leading European bridge for Asian financial institutions, we accelerate your international trading.

Our dedicated team of six brokers eliminates cross-border complexity by supporting your business natively in English, Chinese, Japanese, and Korean.

Through this seamless, multilingual approach, we deliver tailored market advice and help you optimize your portfolio with competitive brokering in deposits, CD/CP, T-Bills, Bonds, and FX-swaps.

Our team will be on-site on September 16th-18th in Barcelona. Drop by for a quick chat or connect with us at <a class="link" href="mailto:asia-desk@afsgroup.nl?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>asia-desk@afsgroup.nl</a>


